From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] ui-egui: the tool panels show no milestone banner or badges;
 tools that are not built are not listed

Phase 4 i18n pass: the Edit tool showed 'Coming in milestone M7. Items marked Ready work today.', a green Ready badge on every working tool and a grey M12 badge on the others. Now a tool that is planned only (catalog Availability::Planned) is not listed (panels, command palette), a group is listed when at least one of its tools works, Ready tools carry no badge, the banner is gone, and running a planned command by id says 'is not available yet' instead of naming a milestone. The AI-provider badge stays.
---
